    "For me, the most enjoyable part is the puzzle, the process of solving, not the solution itself. — Ernő Rubik" : {
      "comment" : "A quote by the famous cognitive scientist and psychologist, Ernő Rubik, that describes the importance of the process of solving puzzles rather than just the final solution.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für mich ist der angenehmste Teil das Rätsel, der Lösungsprozess, nicht die Lösung selbst. — Ernő Rubik"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para mí, la parte más agradable es el rompecabezas, el proceso de resolución, no la solución en sí. - Ernő Rubik"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour moi, la partie la plus agréable est le puzzle, le processus de résolution, pas la solution elle-même. - Ernő Rubik"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "मेरे लिए, सबसे सुखद हिस्सा पहेली है, हल करने की प्रक्रिया, समाधान ही नहीं। - एर्नो रूबिक"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per me, la parte più piacevole è il puzzle, il processo di risoluzione, non la soluzione stessa. — Ernő Rubik"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
